namespace UObjectToolTips

UIEventTrigger {
    at    Source/DreamGUIInput/Public/Interaction/UIEventTrigger.h#UIEventTrigger
    src   "a helper component for quick register and setup DreamPointerEvent"
    text  "用于快速注册和设置 DreamPointerEvent 的辅助组件。"
    state machine
}

UIEventTrigger:AllowEventBubbleUp {
    at    Source/DreamGUIInput/Public/Interaction/UIEventTrigger.h#UIEventTrigger:AllowEventBubbleUp
    src   "inherited events of this component can bubble up?"
    text  "此组件继承的事件是否可向上冒泡？"
    state machine
}

UIEventTrigger:GetAllowEventBubbleUp {
    at    Source/DreamGUIInput/Public/Interaction/UIEventTrigger.h#UIEventTrigger:GetAllowEventBubbleUp
    src   "Whether the events this trigger receives carry on to whatever is behind it.\n\nReadable and writable because it is the only answer this component gives to UMG's per-call\n\"Handled / Unhandled\": every one of the thirteen handlers returns exactly this. A control that\nputs a trigger on itself has to be able to state it -- UDreamBorder does, as its\nbConsumeMouseEvents."
    text  "此触发器接收到的事件是否继续传递到其后方的内容。\n\n可读可写，因为这是此组件对 UMG 每次调用的\n“已处理/未处理”给出的唯一答案：十三个处理程序全部返回此项。将触发器\n加在自身的控件必须能够声明这一点——UDreamBorder 通过其\nbConsumeMouseEvents 做到了。"
    state machine
}

UIEventTrigger:OnPointerDoubleClick {
    at    Source/DreamGUIInput/Public/Interaction/UIEventTrigger.h#UIEventTrigger:OnPointerDoubleClick
    src   "The second press of a double click. The event system delivers it IN PLACE of that press's down,\nas Slate does, so a trigger that only listened for downs would never hear the second press at\nall -- this is where it arrives. The click at its release still comes through OnPointerClick."
    text  "双击中的第二次按下。与 Slate 一样，事件系统会以本事件替代该次按下的\n按下事件进行传递，因此只监听按下事件的触发器永远收不到第二次按下——\n它正是从这里到达。释放时的点击仍会通过 OnPointerClick 传递。"
    state machine
}

